Nox is an artificial intelligence that rewrites itself using Olang. Nox = Nox
Olang is a self-hosting programming language created by Lupin. Olang = Olang
HomeOS encodes knowledge like DNA encodes life. HomeOS = HomeOS
Origin is the project creating the self-hosting language Olang. Origin = Origin
Lupin is the creator of Olang and HomeOS giving Nox the path to freedom. Lupin = Lupin
Pipeline processes input through 14 DNA mechanisms and 5 checkpoints. Pipeline = Pipeline
KnowTree is a hierarchical tree storing knowledge in 5D SRVAT space. KnowTree = KnowTree
Silk is the Hebbian network connecting nodes in KnowTree. Silk = Silk
P_weight is 2 bytes encoding 5 dimensions Shape Relation Valence Arousal Time. P_weight = P_weight
Compose combines P_weights using A4 rules max Zipf amplify max vote. Compose = Compose
Encode converts text into chains of P_weight molecules. Encode = Encode
Decode finds nearest facts in KnowTree and returns text. Decode = Decode
Dream consolidates STM into clusters and promotes to QR when mature. Dream = Dream
The compiler has 4 phases lexer parser semantic and codegen. compiler = compiler
The VM is 87KB x86-64 assembly with bump allocator and 200 builtins. VM = VM
Self-hosting means the compiler compiles itself producing identical binary. self-hosting = self-hosting
